{"id":"661162","name":"干锅鸡翅虾","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661162/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡中翅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡中翅洗净备用。","img":"images/661162/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入蚝油，老抽，孜然烧烤料。","img":"images/661162/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"抓拌均匀腌制入味。","img":"images/661162/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"虾剪去虾枪后去除虾脑虾线。","img":"images/661162/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洋葱洗净切细备用。","img":"images/661162/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净切条。","img":"images/661162/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"不粘锅将鸡翅下锅煎。","img":"images/661162/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煎至两面金黄后夹出。","img":"images/661162/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"土豆均匀的裹上土豆淀粉。","img":"images/661162/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中热油放入土豆。","img":"images/661162/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"中小火炒至金黄后盛出。","img":"images/661162/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"虾也均匀裹上一层玉米淀粉。","img":"images/661162/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅中底油放入虾，中小火慢慢煸炒，炒至金黄焦脆。","img":"images/661162/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"锅中底油放入洋葱。","img":"images/661162/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入干锅酱。","img":"images/661162/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入煎好的鸡翅。","img":"images/661162/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入炸好的土豆。","img":"images/661162/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放入虾。","img":"images/661162/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"大火快速翻炒均匀入味即可。","img":"images/661162/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"最后加上白芝麻和香菜即可。","img":"images/661162/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661162/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661162/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}